## Why This Is Asked
Tests designing a practical, on-device ML flow that balances accuracy, size, privacy, and deployment realities.

## Key Concepts
- On-device constraints: memory, CPU, quantization
- Feature engineering: cyclical time, geospatial bucketing, hashed categories
- Model choice: compact linear models with proper regularization
- Privacy-aware validation: leave-one-user-out or per-session splits
- Evaluation: AUROC, calibration, appropriate thresholds

## Code Example
